  "description": "Single Speed 26\" Beach Cruiser Bike for Men – The Perfect Blend of Simplicity and Style\nTracer Avera Beach Cruiser Bike for Women,2 6 Inch Wheels, Hi Ten Steel Frame,Shimano 1 Speed, Hybrid Bike for Men, Complete Cruiser Bikes, Multiple Colors\n\nHybrid Bike for Women combines the features of a comfort bike, a commuter bike and a cruiser bike\nSingle-speed model offers ultimate simplicity, and is ideal for flat terrain\nIntuitive rear coaster brake (pedal backwards to stop) provides simple stopping power\nHigh-density foam grips on the wide handlebars, a dual-spring cushioned wide seat that ensures tailbone comfort on long rides\n\nFRAME\n\nTracer Hi-ten steel Classical 26*17\"\n\nFORK\n\nTracer Hi-ten Steel 3/8\"*22.2*25.4*152*28.6*1.4*390*102mm\n\nSHOCK\n\nN/A\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nTracer Steel Moon-Type 680*22.2*1.4T\n\nSTEM\n\nAlloy 22.2*25.4*180mm Heavy Duty, Ext:80mm\n\nHEADSET\n\nSteel Diameter 1\"*22.2\"30*27mm, H:34mm\n\nSEATPOST\n\nSteel 25.4*300*1.4T\n\nSADDLE\n\nVacuum elastic PVC leather+high density PU foam with springs\n\nSHIFTERS\n\nN/A\n\nFRONT DERAILLEUR\n\nN/A\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\nN/A\n\nBRAKE\n\nKT coaster\n\nBRAKE LEVERS\n\nN/A\n\nCASSETTE\n\n22T\n\nCHAIN\n\nC410 1/2\"*1/8\"*110L\n\nCRANKSET\n\nAlloy/Steel 1/2*1/8*44T, Crank Arm Length: 165mm\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nSteel for One Piece Cranks\n\nRIMS\n\nWide:33mm 26*14G*1.75*36H, H:15.9\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nSF-HB03F, 3/8\"*14G*36H*100*140mm\n\nREAR HUB\n\nKT-305RA coaster, 3/8*14G*36H*110*150mm\n\nSPOKES\n\nStainless Steel 14G gauge\n\nTIRES\n\nBlack, 26*3.0\"\n\nFENDERS\n\nPainted steel fenders\n\nMEAS\n\n145*18*71cm\n\nEXTRAS\n\nCustom designed rear alloy rack, reflectors, steel kickstand\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
